sequenceDiagram
  title Issuing and verifying a certificate
  actor C as Coordinator
  actor S as Student
  actor V as Anyone verifying
  participant A as Server action
  participant CS as Certificate service
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant PDF as PDF drawing (pdf-lib)

  C->>A: Issue certificates (event has ended)
  A->>CS: generateCertificates(actor, eventId, now)
  CS->>D: BEGIN, lock event, read attendance and results
  CS->>CS: Attended: participation. Won and attended: merit too
  CS->>D: INSERT certificates with random verify codes, COMMIT
  CS-->>C: How many were issued
  CS-->>S: Email and bell: your certificates are ready

  S->>A: GET /api/v1/certificates/:id
  A->>CS: Is this theirs, or their event's staff?
  CS->>D: Read the certificate
  CS->>PDF: Draw it now, with a QR code linking to the verify page
  PDF-->>S: PDF download

  V->>A: Scans the QR: /certificates/verify?code=
  A->>D: Find the certificate by code
  alt Found
    D-->>V: Name, team, event, dates and type
  else Withdrawn or never existed
    D-->>V: Not a valid certificate
  end
